    "summary_one_sentence": "Trapped in an isolated setting, two teenage boys must flee a relentless, violent entity that disguises itself as their deepest desire—each other.",
    "summary_short": "In a harrowing blend of horror, romance, and drama, two teenage boys find themselves hunted by a terrifying supernatural force. The creature preys on their unspoken feelings, transforming into the exact likeness of the person each boy desires most. As the lines between love and deception blur, they are forced to confront both the monster outside and their true emotions within. To survive the night, they must learn to distinguish real affection from a fatal illusion.",
    "summary_long": "Leviticus follows two teenage best friends whose burgeoning romantic feelings for one another take a dark, supernatural turn during an isolated getaway. Their peaceful retreat shatters when a sinister, ancient entity begins stalking them from the surrounding woods. The creature possesses a insidious hunting tactic: it shapeshifts into the form of the individual its target desires above all else. Because both boys harbor secret, intense feelings for one another, the monster repeatedly takes on each boy's likeness to lure the other into deadly traps. Trust quickly unravels as neither teenager can be entirely sure if the person standing before them is his true love or a lethal phantom. As the attacks grow increasingly violent, the boys are forced to articulate their unspoken emotions to create safe words and emotional touchstones. Through a gauntlet of terror, psychological mind games, and physical threats, their bond is tested to its absolute limit. Ultimately, they must combine their resourcefulness and genuinely accept their affection for one another to outsmart the shape-shifting beast and make a desperate bid for freedom.",
    "synopsis": "Leviticus is a chilling horror-drama that explores the delicate intersection of teenage desire and mortal peril. Centered on two long-time male friends grappling with covert romantic feelings, the story unfolds as they encounter an ancient, predatory entity capable of weaponizing human longing. By taking the shape of the person its prey desires most, the monster turns the boys' mutual affection into their greatest vulnerability. Blending atmospheric dread with a tender coming-of-age romance, the narrative delivers a suspenseful story about survival, identity, and the power of authentic connection in the face of absolute terror.",
